            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Polymyositis—high serum creatine kinase activity; generalized electromyogram (EMG) abnormalities; diagnostic muscle biopsies.",
              "pdf_page": 1021,
              "printed_page": 939,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Neurogenic atrophy of temporalis muscles— determined by EMG and muscle biopsy.",
