              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Atrophy of masticatory muscles from corticosteroids—history of corticosteroid use; characteristic changes on muscle biopsy. endocrine disorders—test for thyroid and adrenal disorders.",
